manifest broiler.javascript.wide
atLeast files 53469
atLeast variants 94545
atLeast passed 70834
atMost failed 13315
atMost unsupported 1990
atMost skipped 8346
retired 2026-09-08 atLeast passed 71153, atMost failed 14986, atMost unsupported 0 - set from the whole run of 2026-09-07 taken before the BigInt literal refusal was restored in JsParser.cs; the engine moved rather than the suite, so --admit refused to re-base and this file was edited deliberately. JSC-207.
